   "text": "High Grade BASI by Trade Size\n(bid-ask spread, bp \u00b7 Dec 2017 \u2013 Aug 2021)\n\nMicro \u2264$100k \u2013 widest; peak ~17bp (Mar '20)\nOdd $100k\u2013$1m\nRound $1m\u2013$5m\nBlock $5m+ \u2013 tightest\n\nAll buckets spiked Mar '20, then\ncompressed through 2021",
   "originalText": "High Grade BASI by Trade Size\n(bid-ask spread, bp \u00b7 Dec 2017 \u2013 Aug 2021)\n\nMicro \u2264$100k \u2013 widest; peak ~17bp (Mar '20)\nOdd $100k\u2013$1m\nRound $1m\u2013$5m\nBlock $5m+ \u2013 tightest\n\nAll buckets spiked Mar '20, then\ncompressed through 2021",
